11. Hospitalization:
Hospitalization means admission in a Hospital for a minimum period of 24 consecutive In patient Care hours except for specified procedures/
treatments, where such admission could be for a period of less than 24 consecutive hours.
12. Illness
Illness means a sickness or a disease or pathological condition leading to the impairment of normal physiological function and requires medical
treatment.
